<!doctype lake><title>教案12-字符串</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1 data-lake-id="OmJpr" id="OmJpr"><span data-lake-id="u0e976378" id="u0e976378">1.字符串</span></h1><p data-lake-id="30669b5ec2834ecc8ba8cf06ce50e9c2" id="30669b5ec2834ecc8ba8cf06ce50e9c2" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u25d4d9cb" id="u25d4d9cb" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符串可以用char型数组保存或者char型指针指向，其中的用法和区别前面已经详解过，这里不再赘述。本章主要学习字符串常用的几个函数。</span></p><p data-lake-id="6aab8e7753d6d7b8bd28c759a9c1d6b9" id="6aab8e7753d6d7b8bd28c759a9c1d6b9"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560157709-43509543-fed8-4222-ab37-69be593100a9.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A530%2C%22height%22%3A330%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1420%2C%22originHeight%22%3A885%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fafafa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FiRp0%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="YqeHk" id="YqeHk"><span data-lake-id="u4d352b55" id="u4d352b55">2.字符串读写</span></h1><p data-lake-id="085ffc6d3d768280dd7984cae78a2be0" id="085ffc6d3d768280dd7984cae78a2be0"><span data-lake-id="u987bba9f" id="u987bba9f" class="lake-fontsize-12">用printf 函数和puts 函数输出字符串</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20str%5B%5D%3D%20%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cstr)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%8D%A2%E8%A1%8C%5Cnputs(str)%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%8D%A2%E8%A1%8C%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BGSCD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="83bc845b349d5a98075ba6aa18f7f54e" id="83bc845b349d5a98075ba6aa18f7f54e"><span data-lake-id="uebdf9ea5" id="uebdf9ea5" class="lake-fontsize-12">用scanf 函数和gets 函数读取字符串</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20a%5B10%5D%3B%5Cnscanf(%5C%22%25s%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%5Cngets(a)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NkjHP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="uc33c0dcf"><li fid="uc743562b" data-lake-id="u3d7a6020" id="u3d7a6020"><span data-lake-id="uec23de9b" id="uec23de9b" class="lake-fontsize-12">scanf不能接受空格、制表符Tab、回车等，而gets能够接受。</span></li><li fid="uc743562b" data-lake-id="ue34ed928" id="ue34ed928"><span data-lake-id="udfa6c3cd" id="udfa6c3cd" class="lake-fontsize-12">scanf ：当遇到回车，空格和tab键会自动在字符串后面添加’\0’，但是回车，空格和tab键仍会留在输入的缓冲区中。</span></li><li fid="uc743562b" data-lake-id="u0e8096ad" id="u0e8096ad"><span data-lake-id="u2bdaf343" id="u2bdaf343" class="lake-fontsize-12">gets：可接受回车键之前输入的所有字符，并用’\0’替代 ‘\n’.回车键不会留在输入缓冲区中。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="f1ca2d5209f182c15b2ea9c2f5685c1d" id="f1ca2d5209f182c15b2ea9c2f5685c1d"><span data-lake-id="uad256c48" id="uad256c48" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="YuwDT" id="YuwDT"><span data-lake-id="u96b7ff20" id="u96b7ff20">2.1 gets()</span></h2><table data-lake-id="zDLZZ" id="zDLZZ" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 631px"><colgroup><col width="131"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="ua54eae47" id="ua54eae47" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ud0ee4a5f" id="ud0ee4a5f"><p data-lake-id="90b6d54991d19891a7f0558cddc865aa" id="90b6d54991d19891a7f0558cddc865aa"><strong><span data-lake-id="u083d9a99" id="u083d9a99" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4669110c" id="u4669110c" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="f24e977a5f4d612c03830ce0b2434c05" id="f24e977a5f4d612c03830ce0b2434c05"><span data-lake-id="u0b7f1384" id="u0b7f1384" class="lake-fontsize-12">从标准输入读入字符，并保存到 s 指定的内存空间，直到出现换行符或读到文件结尾为止。</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u1c9f4ade" id="u1c9f4ade" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ud040f16f" id="ud040f16f"><p data-lake-id="7af25efaecb98d051064d421d1b22863" id="7af25efaecb98d051064d421d1b22863"><strong><span data-lake-id="u35d898d4" id="u35d898d4" class="lake-fontsize-12">所需头文件</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5b5e547a" id="u5b5e547a" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="41bf59abc6adfc737b099ef3b47bf9fc" id="41bf59abc6adfc737b099ef3b47bf9fc"><span data-lake-id="u8c26a933" id="u8c26a933" class="lake-fontsize-12">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u892bd470" id="u892bd470" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ue17227d2" id="ue17227d2"><p data-lake-id="2e31b15ab68a17a1077e524ab815bf25" id="2e31b15ab68a17a1077e524ab815bf25"><strong><span data-lake-id="u26766696" id="u26766696" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数原型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud3c9c50d" id="ud3c9c50d" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="e76e2d20ee6ae867ef9e0a8c124c6ef4" id="e76e2d20ee6ae867ef9e0a8c124c6ef4"><span data-lake-id="u95a60002" id="u95a60002" class="lake-fontsize-12">char *gets(char *s);</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u2f26be8c" id="u2f26be8c" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u5921d73d" id="u5921d73d"><p data-lake-id="93d57f8ad9e75dfca30d1cde27d34e62" id="93d57f8ad9e75dfca30d1cde27d34e62"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua953ea4a" id="ua953ea4a" class="lake-fontsize-12">参数</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="udc1336ea" id="udc1336ea"><p data-lake-id="903fb2bb92951b380001ab5a73c55506" id="903fb2bb92951b380001ab5a73c55506"><span data-lake-id="u8ae56430" id="u8ae56430" class="lake-fontsize-12">s</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua499612e" id="ua499612e"><p data-lake-id="3ede16624174bdde162fe79c1690dd69" id="3ede16624174bdde162fe79c1690dd69"><span data-lake-id="ub73f7715" id="ub73f7715" class="lake-fontsize-12">所保存字符串内存的首地址</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ud1b038a3" id="ud1b038a3" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u8d99f237" id="u8d99f237" rowSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="bd8bf85ccce15d778fe50df0cc49c3c2" id="bd8bf85ccce15d778fe50df0cc49c3c2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9c5e337d" id="u9c5e337d" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u505249d7" id="u505249d7"><p data-lake-id="f16dd7f9b42b1f142d0f67de4c50fd3e" id="f16dd7f9b42b1f142d0f67de4c50fd3e"><span data-lake-id="uface7ef2" id="uface7ef2" class="lake-fontsize-12">成功</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u38089172" id="u38089172"><p data-lake-id="a2c788eae21997c51a56e6a10b3aaa48" id="a2c788eae21997c51a56e6a10b3aaa48"><span data-lake-id="uf8f9cfc1" id="uf8f9cfc1" class="lake-fontsize-12">读入的字符串地址</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc37e648a" id="uc37e648a" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ubd596311" id="ubd596311"><p data-lake-id="54d282360fc036cb92a81e974bdcbf48" id="54d282360fc036cb92a81e974bdcbf48"><span data-lake-id="u53029076" id="u53029076" class="lake-fontsize-12">失败</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="udef90a16" id="udef90a16"><p data-lake-id="8e18f0f90eab2f41194ca0155244da95" id="8e18f0f90eab2f41194ca0155244da95"><span data-lake-id="ufe51ca9a" id="ufe51ca9a" class="lake-fontsize-12">NULL</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="339f7d15700e19457dfa4f377e825905" id="339f7d15700e19457dfa4f377e825905"><span data-lake-id="u91f630aa" id="u91f630aa" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：由于 scanf()和 gets()无法知道字符串 s 大小，必须遇到换行符或读到文件结尾为止才接收输入，因此容易导致</span><span data-lake-id="u4b8ba172" id="u4b8ba172" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符数组越界(缓冲区溢出)的情况。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="InZyl" id="InZyl"><span data-lake-id="udcd6961d" id="udcd6961d">2.2 fgets()</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u96529806" id="u96529806"><span data-lake-id="u5a2f11ae" id="u5a2f11ae" class="lake-fontsize-12">面对输入的数据可能存在数字、字符时首选：</span></p><table data-lake-id="FIfT6" id="FIfT6" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 605px"><colgroup><col width="101"><col width="254"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u6f95a608" id="u6f95a608" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ubec72eba" id="ubec72eba"><p data-lake-id="99b7a290d9bc49e52710e8de13d7b68a" id="99b7a290d9bc49e52710e8de13d7b68a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u47a98371" id="u47a98371" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5b087c34" id="u5b087c34" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="e20e84cb80c09b9ac174ca3f82c28298" id="e20e84cb80c09b9ac174ca3f82c28298"><span data-lake-id="u4445f2bc" id="u4445f2bc" class="lake-fontsize-12">从 stream 指定的文件内读入字符，保存到 s 所指定的内存空间， 直到出现换行字符、 读到文件结尾或是已读了 size - 1 个字符为止， 最后会自动加上字符 ‘\0’ 作为字符串结束。</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc4e4e838" id="uc4e4e838" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="uedbc1b8b" id="uedbc1b8b"><p data-lake-id="266f3f1eca01ebf0a099adb331e7e06f" id="266f3f1eca01ebf0a099adb331e7e06f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3cf5466c" id="u3cf5466c" class="lake-fontsize-12">所需头文件</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8d1f7166" id="u8d1f7166" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="16057192216702edce07e4017dadc7ec" id="16057192216702edce07e4017dadc7ec"><span data-lake-id="u8c4d1f8b" id="u8c4d1f8b" class="lake-fontsize-12">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u05be7741" id="u05be7741" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ub700083a" id="ub700083a"><p data-lake-id="cf97c686156fb814db74afaae0730e0f" id="cf97c686156fb814db74afaae0730e0f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u68b2943a" id="u68b2943a" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数原型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua7317bbf" id="ua7317bbf" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="f5399c3d31f99f2e706a9aa9f226e008" id="f5399c3d31f99f2e706a9aa9f226e008"><span data-lake-id="u0d0a399c" id="u0d0a399c" class="lake-fontsize-12">char *fgets(char *s, int size, FILE *stream);</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u8d7b4528" id="u8d7b4528" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u05fc748a" id="u05fc748a" rowSpan="3"><p data-lake-id="68af0372a5e8fee6817e021f4bdcd3b2" id="68af0372a5e8fee6817e021f4bdcd3b2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u56089051" id="u56089051" class="lake-fontsize-12">参数</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5d7b9bc1" id="u5d7b9bc1"><p data-lake-id="a07e65f957df24e01206707a909b2e38" id="a07e65f957df24e01206707a909b2e38"><span data-lake-id="u91e96668" id="u91e96668" class="lake-fontsize-12">s</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubd5c0797" id="ubd5c0797"><p data-lake-id="3fcd205d2e1579dce909ebd482d6fedc" id="3fcd205d2e1579dce909ebd482d6fedc"><span data-lake-id="u3a6b3a80" id="u3a6b3a80" class="lake-fontsize-12">所保存字符串内存的首地址</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ue1772ef5" id="ue1772ef5" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u2eb59056" id="u2eb59056"><p data-lake-id="421b1eb1991081b47b5445989bc73200" id="421b1eb1991081b47b5445989bc73200"><span data-lake-id="u0610d255" id="u0610d255" class="lake-fontsize-12">size</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8d85ef62" id="u8d85ef62"><p data-lake-id="3ff4d5777398ec022033570ea6520e30" id="3ff4d5777398ec022033570ea6520e30"><span data-lake-id="u37d4248d" id="u37d4248d" class="lake-fontsize-12">指定最大读取字符串的长度（size - 1）</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u72212cdf" id="u72212cdf" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u25a8f53b" id="u25a8f53b"><p data-lake-id="6da2d6ad257b5db5e0651ad2e7391256" id="6da2d6ad257b5db5e0651ad2e7391256"><span data-lake-id="u9125ec37" id="u9125ec37" class="lake-fontsize-12">stream</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0afe5211" id="u0afe5211"><p data-lake-id="bdd73177db62e45e016ef72137526456" id="bdd73177db62e45e016ef72137526456"><span data-lake-id="uc588c49d" id="uc588c49d" class="lake-fontsize-12">文件指针，如果读键盘输入的字符串，固定写为 stdin</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="udcba740e" id="udcba740e" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="uc41217b9" id="uc41217b9" rowSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="0da8ffc9454f5dd8f901a400efdb2339" id="0da8ffc9454f5dd8f901a400efdb2339"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9c782fdc" id="u9c782fdc" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub1d9bfe6" id="ub1d9bfe6"><p data-lake-id="0ac899eb6959ffcf0b063a3eddb35e65" id="0ac899eb6959ffcf0b063a3eddb35e65"><span data-lake-id="ucfdc639e" id="ucfdc639e" class="lake-fontsize-12">成功</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u84da28d9" id="u84da28d9"><p data-lake-id="fb8b97fda8783736cbf07a326ef26edb" id="fb8b97fda8783736cbf07a326ef26edb"><span data-lake-id="u3d7769e0" id="u3d7769e0" class="lake-fontsize-12">读入的字符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uf732322b" id="uf732322b" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u9226e997" id="u9226e997"><p data-lake-id="fc43628a1d6aa9808810259c3d37ee81" id="fc43628a1d6aa9808810259c3d37ee81"><span data-lake-id="u329d7814" id="u329d7814" class="lake-fontsize-12">失败</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8cbaeda8" id="u8cbaeda8"><p data-lake-id="133ab02cf7fdc3402a78650fb5cffd04" id="133ab02cf7fdc3402a78650fb5cffd04"><span data-lake-id="ud983d395" id="ud983d395" class="lake-fontsize-12">NULL</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="37564aca59d43a014cecf44aa7240ec3" id="37564aca59d43a014cecf44aa7240ec3"><span data-lake-id="u7900e4dd" id="u7900e4dd" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20a%5B10%5D%3B%5Cnfgets(a%2C5%2Cstdin)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ci1ve%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="40af8c3e9bec1ee3b4169308800a3e4c" id="40af8c3e9bec1ee3b4169308800a3e4c"><span data-lake-id="u2906a0c9" id="u2906a0c9" class="lake-fontsize-12">fgets()在读取一个用户通过键盘输入的字符串的时候，同时把用户输入的回车也做为字符串的一部分。通过 scanf 和 gets 输入一个字符串的时候，不包含结尾的“\n”，但通过 fgets 结尾多了“\n”。fgets()函数是安全的，不存在缓冲区溢出的问题。</span></p><p data-lake-id="3c2799fab5dae1fecb346a6c74dc73a9" id="3c2799fab5dae1fecb346a6c74dc73a9"><span data-lake-id="u700bc875" id="u700bc875" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h1 data-lake-id="Xt0ib" id="Xt0ib"><span data-lake-id="u27fbd685" id="u27fbd685">3.字符串函数</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id="HAzqJ" id="HAzqJ"><span data-lake-id="u9ad5b4fe" id="u9ad5b4fe">3.1 strstr()</span></h2><table data-lake-id="hZwaN" id="hZwaN" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 604px"><colgroup><col width="104"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="uf5ed18df" id="uf5ed18df" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u13697087" id="u13697087"><p data-lake-id="f18472bafa941a909d2bcdb678e408d0" id="f18472bafa941a909d2bcdb678e408d0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub735f594" id="ub735f594" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua9cd26f8" id="ua9cd26f8" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="218d9d2d95e5043b52a9ada0de1060ae" id="218d9d2d95e5043b52a9ada0de1060ae"><span data-lake-id="ucf91572b" id="ucf91572b" class="lake-fontsize-12">在一个指定的字符串中，找到一个子串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u02a74f10" id="u02a74f10" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="uf30fddcb" id="uf30fddcb"><p data-lake-id="8512489cc4aec846c1dae960d0b703a3" id="8512489cc4aec846c1dae960d0b703a3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8e295821" id="u8e295821" class="lake-fontsize-12">所需头文件</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="uac974b3f" id="uac974b3f" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="63fcf254f78edce0f84299380be284ee" id="63fcf254f78edce0f84299380be284ee"><span data-lake-id="u198a3b1f" id="u198a3b1f" class="lake-fontsize-12">#include &lt;string.h&gt;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u09952891" id="u09952891" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u9e267e4c" id="u9e267e4c"><p data-lake-id="7260d57f466cfce5c13764b52d071ef0" id="7260d57f466cfce5c13764b52d071ef0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0a8129cb" id="u0a8129cb" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数原型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u919d9f59" id="u919d9f59" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="1fd7207a75c664f4dbbbf5cbc91958c5" id="1fd7207a75c664f4dbbbf5cbc91958c5"><span data-lake-id="u9ce535cb" id="u9ce535cb" class="lake-fontsize-12">char *</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4a15bd8a" id="u4a15bd8a" class="lake-fontsize-12">strstr</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua050ffa5" id="ua050ffa5" class="lake-fontsize-12">(const char *haystack, const char *needle);</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u8a441922" id="u8a441922" style="height: 38px"><td data-lake-id="ud3b2cf0c" id="ud3b2cf0c" rowSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="8863d929a274b11c0c6fd3efa4493144" id="8863d929a274b11c0c6fd3efa4493144"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc66e0dd7" id="uc66e0dd7" class="lake-fontsize-12">参数</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="uae8d9b27" id="uae8d9b27"><p data-lake-id="49fee914e8baae0eb64d2bc8bb8fa2f8" id="49fee914e8baae0eb64d2bc8bb8fa2f8"><span data-lake-id="u343401ca" id="u343401ca" class="lake-fontsize-12">haystack</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubff5c81c" id="ubff5c81c"><p data-lake-id="1a35f76bbe785b9f2bc86c386ac8ad38" id="1a35f76bbe785b9f2bc86c386ac8ad38"><span data-lake-id="u22067f97" id="u22067f97" class="lake-fontsize-12">指定的字符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ubf700f6e" id="ubf700f6e" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u6971c4f1" id="u6971c4f1"><p data-lake-id="fea6475b0b45d6e2cc6476a759a8ab78" id="fea6475b0b45d6e2cc6476a759a8ab78"><span data-lake-id="u6b9b421a" id="u6b9b421a" class="lake-fontsize-12">needle</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u38245113" id="u38245113"><p data-lake-id="5bb1179903777c417f18586acef97d00" id="5bb1179903777c417f18586acef97d00"><span data-lake-id="u31ba73a2" id="u31ba73a2" class="lake-fontsize-12">需要查找的子串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u67c7e76e" id="u67c7e76e" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="uf06186a2" id="uf06186a2" rowSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="45e4831d403924e6279abf6cb9e60457" id="45e4831d403924e6279abf6cb9e60457"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ead86c7" id="u8ead86c7" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucbc208c8" id="ucbc208c8"><p data-lake-id="f5863ee6c3776503bd61f63cd006c92e" id="f5863ee6c3776503bd61f63cd006c92e"><span data-lake-id="u22631f69" id="u22631f69" class="lake-fontsize-12">成功</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uae60368e" id="uae60368e"><p data-lake-id="57d1fc357a21573703859f8b4de3a556" id="57d1fc357a21573703859f8b4de3a556"><span data-lake-id="ubb5ba71e" id="ubb5ba71e" class="lake-fontsize-12">指向子串的指针</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u18ab0d98" id="u18ab0d98" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u00e701d9" id="u00e701d9"><p data-lake-id="4fd09b04b03b2b484054ffc95c3e2c88" id="4fd09b04b03b2b484054ffc95c3e2c88"><span data-lake-id="ua9c0a9f1" id="ua9c0a9f1" class="lake-fontsize-12">失败</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u76562c96" id="u76562c96"><p data-lake-id="71215227c734b168f184ddfe686b444d" id="71215227c734b168f184ddfe686b444d"><span data-lake-id="u81c922a3" id="u81c922a3" class="lake-fontsize-12">NULL</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20*s%20%3D%20%5C%22abcd.txt%5C%22%3B%5Cnchar%20*p%20%3D%20strstr(s%2C%20%5C%22.wps%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%5Cnif(p%20%3D%3D%20NULL)%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5B%25s%5D%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AFWPS%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20s)%3B%5Cnelse%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5B%25s%5D%E6%98%AFWPS%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20s)%3Bs%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lVwpJ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="efe0a24375b8b0fbf518f1c99f42fbce" id="efe0a24375b8b0fbf518f1c99f42fbce"><span data-lake-id="u9d9b0431" id="u9d9b0431" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="kr25I" id="kr25I"><span data-lake-id="u80011e29" id="u80011e29">3.2 strtok()</span></h2><table data-lake-id="ShpzN" id="ShpzN" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="250"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u3c038881" id="u3c038881" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u2632c2e1" id="u2632c2e1"><p data-lake-id="691cfaad5e66db31503b341199fb560a" id="691cfaad5e66db31503b341199fb560a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua917b048" id="ua917b048" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="uec4661db" id="uec4661db" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="a0eaf34807595afded3c631773bcddce" id="a0eaf34807595afded3c631773bcddce"><span data-lake-id="u086bfd5c" id="u086bfd5c" class="lake-fontsize-12">将某个字符串，按照指定的分隔符拆解为子串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u94cc359b" id="u94cc359b" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u721a2130" id="u721a2130"><p data-lake-id="a2e4f562d1344499fbdd4986773a15a0" id="a2e4f562d1344499fbdd4986773a15a0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1adb689f" id="u1adb689f" class="lake-fontsize-12">所需头文件</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf7ee4946" id="uf7ee4946" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="7833eec6182614c7495ea97b182da21f" id="7833eec6182614c7495ea97b182da21f"><span data-lake-id="u328f49dd" id="u328f49dd" class="lake-fontsize-12">#include &lt;string.h&gt;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u91690b6c" id="u91690b6c" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ub6a9d2a2" id="ub6a9d2a2"><p data-lake-id="a0219737f61f5ea11e8cf313bc400798" id="a0219737f61f5ea11e8cf313bc400798"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue196b7bd" id="ue196b7bd" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数原型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u988119c9" id="u988119c9" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="4b99257aafe2111b33a5062c362e406f" id="4b99257aafe2111b33a5062c362e406f"><span data-lake-id="uc6181a8c" id="uc6181a8c" class="lake-fontsize-12">char *</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua1a75d2f" id="ua1a75d2f" class="lake-fontsize-12">strtok</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc2909bd5" id="uc2909bd5" class="lake-fontsize-12">(char *str, const char *delim);</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uaec8fee9" id="uaec8fee9" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="uf5571c90" id="uf5571c90" rowSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="abf71f7d4af3f9dcfeb2ec91a67db1d4" id="abf71f7d4af3f9dcfeb2ec91a67db1d4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2233c5a5" id="u2233c5a5" class="lake-fontsize-12">参数</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3d3b89c8" id="u3d3b89c8"><p data-lake-id="e23d9fbe72fea7cee609bf5e9afeb2b3" id="e23d9fbe72fea7cee609bf5e9afeb2b3"><span data-lake-id="ub6894c89" id="ub6894c89" class="lake-fontsize-12">str</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ufbea17a9" id="ufbea17a9"><p data-lake-id="f650c5b73e2ff3efb3741aad1d1a99fd" id="f650c5b73e2ff3efb3741aad1d1a99fd"><span data-lake-id="u66004524" id="u66004524" class="lake-fontsize-12">指定要拆解的字符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc6369a45" id="uc6369a45" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ucb29aabd" id="ucb29aabd"><p data-lake-id="f160a9f2b8578fdfecaf7779cf4ad525" id="f160a9f2b8578fdfecaf7779cf4ad525"><span data-lake-id="u1ed2a0f7" id="u1ed2a0f7" class="lake-fontsize-12">delim</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc098adac" id="uc098adac"><p data-lake-id="217187ffaebb98d392ea1a3c8d2fdc3b" id="217187ffaebb98d392ea1a3c8d2fdc3b"><span data-lake-id="ue215ea8e" id="ue215ea8e" class="lake-fontsize-12">分隔符，此处可以指定多个分隔符，形成一个分隔符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="udaab5c17" id="udaab5c17" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u9a9be925" id="u9a9be925" rowSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="a4db3a0f0aced52dbac97eb4eb803cf8" id="a4db3a0f0aced52dbac97eb4eb803cf8"><strong><span data-lake-id="uab5ab992" id="uab5ab992" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u810a9145" id="u810a9145"><p data-lake-id="66197fb95dd32760ab2bedbcb40fe3b5" id="66197fb95dd32760ab2bedbcb40fe3b5"><span data-lake-id="u2d2750f7" id="u2d2750f7" class="lake-fontsize-12">成功</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u071f67cc" id="u071f67cc"><p data-lake-id="4728f9a78bc784d025f42441ed7ba0af" id="4728f9a78bc784d025f42441ed7ba0af"><span data-lake-id="ubb06b256" id="ubb06b256" class="lake-fontsize-12">指向子串的指针</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u75c454d4" id="u75c454d4" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u90d908ae" id="u90d908ae"><p data-lake-id="6be4a7f594527d1a374a448304930616" id="6be4a7f594527d1a374a448304930616"><span data-lake-id="ua041549c" id="ua041549c" class="lake-fontsize-12">失败</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua4214da2" id="ua4214da2"><p data-lake-id="e59bc8d6b250484e7a42f4ff58c6a6d6" id="e59bc8d6b250484e7a42f4ff58c6a6d6"><span data-lake-id="u308b4b0c" id="u308b4b0c" class="lake-fontsize-12">NULL，代表拆解完毕</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="5635bf45e5006c72605765a1ba2e364b" id="5635bf45e5006c72605765a1ba2e364b"><span data-lake-id="u21794d7f" id="u21794d7f" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：</span></p><ul list="u5eb38af7"><li fid="uc4c7b380" data-lake-id="u72f75a82" id="u72f75a82"><span data-lake-id="u838baeaa" id="u838baeaa" class="lake-fontsize-12">该函数会将改变原始字符串 str，使其所包含的所有分隔符变成结束标记 '\0'。</span></li><li fid="uc4c7b380" data-lake-id="ufcee2998" id="ufcee2998"><span data-lake-id="ub65275d9" id="ub65275d9" class="lake-fontsize-12">由于该函数需要更改字符串 str，因此 str 指向的内存必须是可写的。</span></li><li fid="uc4c7b380" data-lake-id="u148afbc7" id="u148afbc7"><span data-lake-id="uff3b9e97" id="uff3b9e97" class="lake-fontsize-12">首次调用时 str 指向原始字符串，此后每次调用 str 用 NULL 代替。</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20s%5B20%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22www.baidu.com%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Cnchar%20*p%20%3D%20strtok(s%2C%20%5C%22.%5C%22)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8Cs%20%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%5Cnwhile(p%20!%3D%20NULL)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20p)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20p%20%3D%20strtok(NULL%2C%20%5C%22.%5C%22)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%AD%A4%E5%90%8E%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%9D%87%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%20NULL%20%E4%BB%A3%E6%9B%BF%E3%80%82%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XCuvy%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="YifuN" id="YifuN"><span data-lake-id="uff3e3cb5" id="uff3e3cb5">3.3 strcat()和strncat()</span></h2><table data-lake-id="KXxrL" id="KXxrL" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 519px"><colgroup><col width="111"><col width="158"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u7f503a58" id="u7f503a58" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u1df650db" id="u1df650db"><p data-lake-id="4c0e39786def0c2ac3776a63106a3cb0" id="4c0e39786def0c2ac3776a63106a3cb0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufb7505e9" id="ufb7505e9" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5dbaecf0" id="u5dbaecf0" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="56a238965c3701171fbe204ede46bdaa" id="56a238965c3701171fbe204ede46bdaa"><span data-lake-id="ud7efecc7" id="ud7efecc7" class="lake-fontsize-12">将</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1f9ae6c2" id="u1f9ae6c2" class="lake-fontsize-12">两个字符串</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub8e60436" id="ub8e60436" class="lake-fontsize-12">拼接起来</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u05831bef" id="u05831bef" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u35117aad" id="u35117aad"><p data-lake-id="ab0b7ca968a85908d19beb083339e6ca" id="ab0b7ca968a85908d19beb083339e6ca"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8bf4011e" id="u8bf4011e" class="lake-fontsize-12">所需头文件</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9a2f4e38" id="u9a2f4e38" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="46269773a3119bb5757b1b23b5313b3b" id="46269773a3119bb5757b1b23b5313b3b"><span data-lake-id="u9b0ad0e0" id="u9b0ad0e0" class="lake-fontsize-12">#include &lt;string.h&gt;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u0f4ec63e" id="u0f4ec63e" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u7930d933" id="u7930d933"><p data-lake-id="6e159bed5a222e88996dd9b2ef1e32c1" id="6e159bed5a222e88996dd9b2ef1e32c1"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue34b2eb0" id="ue34b2eb0" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数原型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2e7c8542" id="u2e7c8542" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="071f4332957bb135c95a16a081f8e15f" id="071f4332957bb135c95a16a081f8e15f"><span data-lake-id="u9fd09529" id="u9fd09529" class="lake-fontsize-12">char *</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uff5b0634" id="uff5b0634" class="lake-fontsize-12">strcat</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud6aa4957" id="ud6aa4957" class="lake-fontsize-12">(char *dest, const char *src);</span></p><p data-lake-id="e66d2992cb9743e35e828aca86432692" id="e66d2992cb9743e35e828aca86432692"><span data-lake-id="u745fe0ec" id="u745fe0ec" class="lake-fontsize-12">char *</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ude255f6b" id="ude255f6b" class="lake-fontsize-12">strnca</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6af21fbb" id="u6af21fbb" class="lake-fontsize-12">t(char *dest, const char *src, size_t</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufeb182bd" id="ufeb182bd" class="lake-fontsize-12"> n);</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u8e17ea5e" id="u8e17ea5e" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u799bd380" id="u799bd380" rowSpan="3"><p data-lake-id="0a805d64dd9c87be889994ce848ad0dd" id="0a805d64dd9c87be889994ce848ad0dd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7b89f57b" id="u7b89f57b" class="lake-fontsize-12">参数</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf879471c" id="uf879471c"><p data-lake-id="c3822750b049931bb53d7ae3a575f1f7" id="c3822750b049931bb53d7ae3a575f1f7"><span data-lake-id="u0b0e637c" id="u0b0e637c" class="lake-fontsize-12">dest</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9efe48d5" id="u9efe48d5"><p data-lake-id="93aa9799189bbf3ecd29a101e544f750" id="93aa9799189bbf3ecd29a101e544f750"><span data-lake-id="ue8f245b4" id="ue8f245b4" class="lake-fontsize-12">指向目标内存，最终存储拼接之后的字符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u7c8f9703" id="u7c8f9703" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u39f04bb9" id="u39f04bb9"><p data-lake-id="53112b68519d90f51639e0067b125501" id="53112b68519d90f51639e0067b125501"><span data-lake-id="ua164d9a5" id="ua164d9a5" class="lake-fontsize-12">src</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uce048ba7" id="uce048ba7"><p data-lake-id="c92440a9ac040ebb8250e3f15e228cc7" id="c92440a9ac040ebb8250e3f15e228cc7"><span data-lake-id="u21309f26" id="u21309f26" class="lake-fontsize-12">指向需要拼接的字符串，最终将 src 拼接到 dest 的后面</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uca519afc" id="uca519afc" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u339be705" id="u339be705"><p data-lake-id="0c33e3676bd44b973d3bd76cc773f683" id="0c33e3676bd44b973d3bd76cc773f683"><span data-lake-id="ue623a0b0" id="ue623a0b0" class="lake-fontsize-12">n</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u30e86235" id="u30e86235"><p data-lake-id="adcc626001601f220941fd6c117876b5" id="adcc626001601f220941fd6c117876b5"><span data-lake-id="u62257bf5" id="u62257bf5" class="lake-fontsize-12">规定最多将 src 中的 n 个字节拼接到 dest 的后面</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u40819326" id="u40819326" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u902d7894" id="u902d7894"><p data-lake-id="d423bd73e5d0a43b94750f62b7f144b1" id="d423bd73e5d0a43b94750f62b7f144b1"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubdaa9dd4" id="ubdaa9dd4" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="udc261e8e" id="udc261e8e" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="ced00367699453e8a88fb59486edba42" id="ced00367699453e8a88fb59486edba42"><span data-lake-id="u86aa19d1" id="u86aa19d1" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回一个指针，指向拼接后的字符串，等价于 dest</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="6acf3e7d073cd1c9338798215fbf45f6" id="6acf3e7d073cd1c9338798215fbf45f6"><span data-lake-id="ub6152a47" id="ub6152a47" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：</span></p><ul list="u47454ff5"><li fid="u36369437" data-lake-id="u6eb540a5" id="u6eb540a5"><span data-lake-id="u74e1eab0" id="u74e1eab0" class="lake-fontsize-12">这两个函数的功能，都是将 src 中的字符串，复制拼接到 dest 的末尾。</span></li><li fid="u36369437" data-lake-id="u6cce460f" id="u6cce460f"><span data-lake-id="u6020d397" id="u6020d397" class="lake-fontsize-12">strcat() 没有边界控制，因此可能会由于 src 的过长而导致内存溢出。</span></li><li fid="u36369437" data-lake-id="u970f8d8d" id="u970f8d8d"><span data-lake-id="ub55d6457" id="ub55d6457" class="lake-fontsize-12">strncat() 有边界控制，最多复制 n+1 个字符（其中最后一个是 '\0' ）到 dest 的末尾。</span></li><li fid="u36369437" data-lake-id="u0ab7968f" id="u0ab7968f"><span data-lake-id="u77881dc0" id="u77881dc0" class="lake-fontsize-12">非字符串不行，如 int 类型数据</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20s1%5B10%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%5Cnstrcat(s1%2C%20%5C%22xyz%5C%22)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20s1)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%20%5C%22abcxyz%5C%22%5Cn%5Cnchar%20s2%5B10%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%5Cnstrcat(s3%2C%20%5C%22123456789%5C%22)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%B4%A9%E6%BA%83%5Cnchar%20s%5B10%5D%20%20%3D%20%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%5Cnstrncat(s%2C%20%5C%22123456789%5C%22%2C%20sizeof(s)-strlen(s)-1)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20s)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%20%5C%22abc123456%5C%22%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E8%A2%AB%E6%8B%BC%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bBqNl%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="6f24f94f11d62208c0b0e4c23bc34a59" id="6f24f94f11d62208c0b0e4c23bc34a59"><span data-lake-id="uac44af29" id="uac44af29" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="Hsti6" id="Hsti6"><span data-lake-id="u4e107bab" id="u4e107bab">3.4 strcpy()和strncpy()</span></h2><table data-lake-id="DghcE" id="DghcE" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 657px"><colgroup><col width="157"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u00f9e435" id="u00f9e435" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u08f1fe70" id="u08f1fe70"><p data-lake-id="5ffe714fcf047f4c064102e0247d724e" id="5ffe714fcf047f4c064102e0247d724e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud1a87139" id="ud1a87139" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub2f8d3be" id="ub2f8d3be" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="865c60ba326ba9c27e6a3a624905593d" id="865c60ba326ba9c27e6a3a624905593d"><span data-lake-id="uc0763f58" id="uc0763f58" class="lake-fontsize-12">复制字符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u6b3f48df" id="u6b3f48df" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u0ec06242" id="u0ec06242"><p data-lake-id="d832eb26db80f0dddc2b6e8605fd5c3c" id="d832eb26db80f0dddc2b6e8605fd5c3c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u08fcb870" id="u08fcb870" class="lake-fontsize-12">所需头文件</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua232960d" id="ua232960d" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="a013d5a28aa0716faf9652ce0ca3647b" id="a013d5a28aa0716faf9652ce0ca3647b"><span data-lake-id="ua735b52d" id="ua735b52d" class="lake-fontsize-12">#include &lt;string.h&gt;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u2ff15a0b" id="u2ff15a0b" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u5feb945e" id="u5feb945e"><p data-lake-id="7341a2d435e12913266935f77be0a83e" id="7341a2d435e12913266935f77be0a83e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u77ad41c2" id="u77ad41c2" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数原型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="uade5f635" id="uade5f635" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="9c94010f70cd2ba2e0eb3d15d7e080ef" id="9c94010f70cd2ba2e0eb3d15d7e080ef"><span data-lake-id="u0259b3a0" id="u0259b3a0" class="lake-fontsize-12">char *</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u52cbd8ee" id="u52cbd8ee" class="lake-fontsize-12">strcpy</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7e052173" id="u7e052173" class="lake-fontsize-12">(char *dest, const char *src);</span></p><p data-lake-id="95f1c4f238f4c0c3e3520734761b5d11" id="95f1c4f238f4c0c3e3520734761b5d11"><span data-lake-id="ud60500db" id="ud60500db" class="lake-fontsize-12">char *</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc1d02a1e" id="uc1d02a1e" class="lake-fontsize-12">strncp</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u46a38b71" id="u46a38b71" class="lake-fontsize-12">y(char *dest, const char *src, size_t</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue1ec4908" id="ue1ec4908" class="lake-fontsize-12"> n);</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u768ac8b3" id="u768ac8b3" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="uf9824f40" id="uf9824f40" rowSpan="3"><p data-lake-id="35921b88629869113520e54a20adc5b9" id="35921b88629869113520e54a20adc5b9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9f7a9860" id="u9f7a9860" class="lake-fontsize-12">参数</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u051dbd31" id="u051dbd31"><p data-lake-id="84d30723c10bfff418d008f3fb1af96e" id="84d30723c10bfff418d008f3fb1af96e"><span data-lake-id="uceb5f3e5" id="uceb5f3e5" class="lake-fontsize-12">dest</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub7abe2c9" id="ub7abe2c9"><p data-lake-id="381f73265780d93c32ce98dffcd2d1b7" id="381f73265780d93c32ce98dffcd2d1b7"><span data-lake-id="u8cbefc67" id="u8cbefc67" class="lake-fontsize-12">指向目标内存，存储复制的字符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u439583a8" id="u439583a8" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u89da2ac1" id="u89da2ac1"><p data-lake-id="987361c5080a25233d64b8ec1de25fd1" id="987361c5080a25233d64b8ec1de25fd1"><span data-lake-id="u55c05de5" id="u55c05de5" class="lake-fontsize-12">src</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="udc2edf6b" id="udc2edf6b"><p data-lake-id="9fa040903c6bc737b0a8109fdb90878f" id="9fa040903c6bc737b0a8109fdb90878f"><span data-lake-id="u5ac26c64" id="u5ac26c64" class="lake-fontsize-12">指向待复制的字符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u57f3a7a1" id="u57f3a7a1" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ub54388c9" id="ub54388c9"><p data-lake-id="b9d89399022e3f5133af859c4b48065b" id="b9d89399022e3f5133af859c4b48065b"><span data-lake-id="uec95aceb" id="uec95aceb" class="lake-fontsize-12">n</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="udb2ce397" id="udb2ce397"><p data-lake-id="3f99a64684b6e20df34bbc5e29ed79dd" id="3f99a64684b6e20df34bbc5e29ed79dd"><span data-lake-id="u96a684ca" id="u96a684ca" class="lake-fontsize-12">规定最多将 src 中的 n 个字节复制到 dest 的后</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u3aeac511" id="u3aeac511" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ud157c496" id="ud157c496"><p data-lake-id="08bf008135631b73fffdf652614fb4bd" id="08bf008135631b73fffdf652614fb4bd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a16270d" id="u6a16270d" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0fb00b7c" id="u0fb00b7c" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="fea1f76eaa5ed1c5416a79156c6e95a7" id="fea1f76eaa5ed1c5416a79156c6e95a7"><span data-lake-id="ud76b13a9" id="ud76b13a9" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回一个指针，指向复制后的字符串，等价于 dest</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="11bbfbe3d14e0086855d419d1ebb07eb" id="11bbfbe3d14e0086855d419d1ebb07eb"><span data-lake-id="u05ad34c5" id="u05ad34c5" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：</span></p><ul list="u537a8812"><li fid="u74b3533f" data-lake-id="u00ac73b4" id="u00ac73b4"><span data-lake-id="u3d2d9c1e" id="u3d2d9c1e" class="lake-fontsize-12">这两个函数的功能，都是将 src 中的字符串，复制到 dest 中。</span></li><li fid="u74b3533f" data-lake-id="ue2ec1d81" id="ue2ec1d81"><span data-lake-id="u348b8856" id="u348b8856" class="lake-fontsize-12">strcpy() 没有边界控制，因此可能会由于 src 的过长而导致内存溢出。</span></li><li fid="u74b3533f" data-lake-id="u690ecfd1" id="u690ecfd1"><span data-lake-id="ua9561aea" id="ua9561aea" class="lake-fontsize-12">strncpy() 有边界控制，最多复制 n+1 个字符（其中最后一个是 '\0' ）到 dest 中。</span></li><li fid="u74b3533f" data-lake-id="u6c23e8ab" id="u6c23e8ab"><u><span data-lake-id="u3a24f1d4" id="u3a24f1d4" class="lake-fontsize-12">新串会覆盖原有旧串</span></u></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20s1%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%5Cnstrcpy(s1%2C%20%5C%22xyz%5C%22)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20s1)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%20%5C%22xyz%5C%22%EF%BC%8C%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%89%E7%9A%84%5C%22abc%5C%22%E8%A2%AB%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%5Cn%5Cnchar%20s2%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%5Cnstrcpy(s2%2C%20%5C%22123456789%5C%22)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%B4%A9%E6%BA%83%5Cnchar%20s%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%5Cnstrncpy(s%2C%20%5C%22123456789%5C%22%2C%20sizeof(s)-1)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20s)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%9C%89%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Em48J%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="1cd2a02980ded429142c4ef5ca8ef30e" id="1cd2a02980ded429142c4ef5ca8ef30e"><span data-lake-id="u26b121ba" id="u26b121ba" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="xutd7" id="xutd7"><span data-lake-id="ucaeda3e8" id="ucaeda3e8">3.5 strcmp()和strncmp()</span></h2><table data-lake-id="vagtm" id="vagtm" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 652px"><colgroup><col width="152"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="ua4e2ca7e" id="ua4e2ca7e" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ubba70fd6" id="ubba70fd6"><p data-lake-id="41e0f980183059bf3196f5570d6c7605" id="41e0f980183059bf3196f5570d6c7605"><strong><span data-lake-id="u253140f4" id="u253140f4" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9f7a97dc" id="u9f7a97dc" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="ae3e652a20e0eaa40cd07d39911fc441" id="ae3e652a20e0eaa40cd07d39911fc441"><span data-lake-id="u9db59776" id="u9db59776" class="lake-fontsize-12">比较两个字符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ud0c4857a" id="ud0c4857a" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u8987e0e6" id="u8987e0e6"><p data-lake-id="9aec109aec76630d36788f4d0bfdec30" id="9aec109aec76630d36788f4d0bfdec30"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubcf49b9e" id="ubcf49b9e" class="lake-fontsize-12">所需头文件</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u61a96fe3" id="u61a96fe3" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="1209ff2c6bc119a3af264ad14da54527" id="1209ff2c6bc119a3af264ad14da54527"><span data-lake-id="u6f7ba889" id="u6f7ba889" class="lake-fontsize-12">#include &lt;string.h&gt;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u646277ea" id="u646277ea" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ua0373e14" id="ua0373e14"><p data-lake-id="15aea38ccf7aee13f0fe8b89ae13b841" id="15aea38ccf7aee13f0fe8b89ae13b841"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8edc15ac" id="u8edc15ac" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数原型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u83cad1ac" id="u83cad1ac" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="04b613acf54635c2b05e58001b628e0a" id="04b613acf54635c2b05e58001b628e0a"><span data-lake-id="u43e28a6f" id="u43e28a6f" class="lake-fontsize-12">int </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u47bcbd4d" id="u47bcbd4d" class="lake-fontsize-12">strcmp</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u339d5f1a" id="u339d5f1a" class="lake-fontsize-12">(const char *s1, const char *s2);</span></p><p data-lake-id="0f14bf580136b364dc4df379d52f35fc" id="0f14bf580136b364dc4df379d52f35fc"><span data-lake-id="u578e1bf1" id="u578e1bf1" class="lake-fontsize-12">int </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5b8b0481" id="u5b8b0481" class="lake-fontsize-12">strncm</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u15d430af" id="u15d430af" class="lake-fontsize-12">p(const char *s1, const char *s2, size</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucfd7aa7a" id="ucfd7aa7a" class="lake-fontsize-12">_t n);</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uffa8f2fa" id="uffa8f2fa" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u38acbffc" id="u38acbffc" rowSpan="3"><p data-lake-id="fb114646fa9bebee333b89bfe3de6caa" id="fb114646fa9bebee333b89bfe3de6caa"><strong><span data-lake-id="u92cd886c" id="u92cd886c" class="lake-fontsize-12">参数</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3081e5c8" id="u3081e5c8"><p data-lake-id="184aafc11b577a6f2ff296cdeac296a7" id="184aafc11b577a6f2ff296cdeac296a7"><span data-lake-id="ue6bc81c6" id="ue6bc81c6" class="lake-fontsize-12">s1</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubecf504d" id="ubecf504d"><p data-lake-id="ea55230bbed54e7589e904a21b2ddbbd" id="ea55230bbed54e7589e904a21b2ddbbd"><span data-lake-id="ua3598a85" id="ua3598a85" class="lake-fontsize-12">待比较的字符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u6c59d1df" id="u6c59d1df" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ue022d387" id="ue022d387"><p data-lake-id="d9d69963d953a2edca8740c961ef8c69" id="d9d69963d953a2edca8740c961ef8c69"><span data-lake-id="u4af790f4" id="u4af790f4" class="lake-fontsize-12">s2</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uef82d144" id="uef82d144"><p data-lake-id="f001eea7b64e31ea25ee34c8458d304c" id="f001eea7b64e31ea25ee34c8458d304c"><span data-lake-id="ue9bfc0ed" id="ue9bfc0ed" class="lake-fontsize-12">待比较的字符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ucf35b9df" id="ucf35b9df" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u05df3805" id="u05df3805"><p data-lake-id="6dd6bfb8148b74f7765dee9743c203a8" id="6dd6bfb8148b74f7765dee9743c203a8"><span data-lake-id="ue3972b5d" id="ue3972b5d" class="lake-fontsize-12">n</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4b030f46" id="u4b030f46"><p data-lake-id="4532398e03f3449a41e754fc778687c4" id="4532398e03f3449a41e754fc778687c4"><span data-lake-id="ue92ed2f5" id="ue92ed2f5" class="lake-fontsize-12">比较字符串的前 n 个字节</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uffcc292d" id="uffcc292d" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ue474e543" id="ue474e543"><p data-lake-id="d84345337a492df2041b19fb3f3538e2" id="d84345337a492df2041b19fb3f3538e2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4a6bd440" id="u4a6bd440" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0e1cc40a" id="u0e1cc40a" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="fa2f1a89ad528c5c820517b7698407ca" id="fa2f1a89ad528c5c820517b7698407ca"><span data-lake-id="u353ffa8d" id="u353ffa8d" class="lake-fontsize-12">当s1大于、等于或者小于s2时，返回1、0或者-1</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="a259643c5e6a64cbfbb82ad13272c6d3" id="a259643c5e6a64cbfbb82ad13272c6d3"><span data-lake-id="u0a201c36" id="u0a201c36" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意</span></p><ul list="u5cf7c9d8"><li fid="u81c14ba6" data-lake-id="udc14385d" id="udc14385d"><span data-lake-id="u0a232b5d" id="u0a232b5d" class="lake-fontsize-12">比较字符串大小，实际上比较的是字符的 ASCII码值的大小。</span></li><li fid="u81c14ba6" data-lake-id="u93272022" id="u93272022"><span data-lake-id="u55e850dc" id="u55e850dc" class="lake-fontsize-12">从左到右逐个比较两个字符串的每一个字符，当能“决出胜负”时立刻停止比较。</span></li><li fid="u81c14ba6" data-lake-id="ub6f2b21b" id="ub6f2b21b" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="udea0690b" id="udea0690b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">会先比较第一个字符如果第一个字符不同，会直接返回1或-1（第一个ascll码大返回1，否则返回-1）</span><span data-lake-id="u2d106627" id="u2d106627" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">也就是说某个字符比较出结果后，后面剩下的字符不会做比较</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20strcmp(%5C%22abc%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22abc%5C%22))%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA0%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E7%9B%B8%E7%AD%89%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20strcmp(%5C%22abc%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22aBc%5C%22))%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA1%EF%BC%8C%5C%22abc%5C%22%20%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%8E%20%5C%22aBc%5C%22%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20strcmp(%5C%22999%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22aaa%5C%22))%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA-1%EF%BC%8C%5C%22999%5C%22%20%E5%B0%8F%E4%BA%8E%20%5C%22aaa%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22goTbU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="JUcpB" id="JUcpB"><span data-lake-id="u70d10027" id="u70d10027">3.6 strchr()和strrchr()</span></h2><table data-lake-id="QJSMO" id="QJSMO" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 644px"><colgroup><col width="144"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u39ccdce0" id="u39ccdce0" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u327ee199" id="u327ee199"><p data-lake-id="cbcc132934d7995a90e7fdd0a701fa0a" id="cbcc132934d7995a90e7fdd0a701fa0a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue1a83661" id="ue1a83661" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u06752407" id="u06752407" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="1312183711b5a52ade0f844357a67c25" id="1312183711b5a52ade0f844357a67c25"><span data-lake-id="ufbc18499" id="ufbc18499">在字符串中查找某个字符第一次出现的位置</span><span data-lake-id="u4574a387" id="u4574a387" class="lake-fontsize-12">的函数</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua3376b02" id="ua3376b02" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="uc9c581ee" id="uc9c581ee"><p data-lake-id="29a6718d451dae4f2c9c653b20a26500" id="29a6718d451dae4f2c9c653b20a26500"><strong><span data-lake-id="u955f0d8e" id="u955f0d8e" class="lake-fontsize-12">所需头文件</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4bfd2b8f" id="u4bfd2b8f" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="9485cd66b89b25afb4ae8999633a51b8" id="9485cd66b89b25afb4ae8999633a51b8"><span data-lake-id="u60e46c66" id="u60e46c66" class="lake-fontsize-12">#include &lt;string.h&gt;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u923bbb5b" id="u923bbb5b" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u67cd4b2c" id="u67cd4b2c"><p data-lake-id="d8bcf11a6b1ceb37380938a3cc51b873" id="d8bcf11a6b1ceb37380938a3cc51b873"><strong><span data-lake-id="u855a41f4" id="u855a41f4" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数原型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4aabc83d" id="u4aabc83d" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="9e2a8a462c55c9a1b51ddc4d98000f09" id="9e2a8a462c55c9a1b51ddc4d98000f09"><span data-lake-id="ud115bf23" id="ud115bf23" class="lake-fontsize-12">char *</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub8b02ac7" id="ub8b02ac7" class="lake-fontsize-12">strchr</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucbfd86b0" id="ucbfd86b0" class="lake-fontsize-12">(const char *s, int c);</span></p><p data-lake-id="77b22ea5f4bd1ca198db428614d59de4" id="77b22ea5f4bd1ca198db428614d59de4"><span data-lake-id="ud7193590" id="ud7193590" class="lake-fontsize-12">char *</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u86509212" id="u86509212" class="lake-fontsize-12">strrch</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7a07240b" id="u7a07240b" class="lake-fontsize-12">r(const char *s, int c);</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uec61e4cb" id="uec61e4cb" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u8fffa435" id="u8fffa435" rowSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="b1a7e288c93d4efc4e3eeb4a7e2b184f" id="b1a7e288c93d4efc4e3eeb4a7e2b184f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u56981ff8" id="u56981ff8" class="lake-fontsize-12">参数</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2cd07e71" id="u2cd07e71"><p data-lake-id="d262ef372929d1ea08ae69fb98328c77" id="d262ef372929d1ea08ae69fb98328c77"><span data-lake-id="uded481de" id="uded481de" class="lake-fontsize-12">s</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u694ff767" id="u694ff767"><p data-lake-id="e3ab0be287920cd04e621f7250cf9b60" id="e3ab0be287920cd04e621f7250cf9b60"><span data-lake-id="u643f216e" id="u643f216e" class="lake-fontsize-12">指定字符串</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u1ec1d2a6" id="u1ec1d2a6" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u4df9d22e" id="u4df9d22e"><p data-lake-id="3b9c7ae2a5f2e6ff7814115be5eec1bb" id="3b9c7ae2a5f2e6ff7814115be5eec1bb"><span data-lake-id="uf7ef4477" id="uf7ef4477" class="lake-fontsize-12">c</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u78ae9a71" id="u78ae9a71"><p data-lake-id="5566ab3cd0f8a84ee99a6fd8f96f4d47" id="5566ab3cd0f8a84ee99a6fd8f96f4d47"><span data-lake-id="u83992f68" id="u83992f68" class="lake-fontsize-12">待查字符</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ube2e5437" id="ube2e5437" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u16abdc58" id="u16abdc58" rowSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="5b85d803c8431befa419b4478dc9cf82" id="5b85d803c8431befa419b4478dc9cf82"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc8e462e4" id="uc8e462e4" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5fd936d6" id="u5fd936d6"><p data-lake-id="d3c1a1ae42c94834bb5d218442b8df95" id="d3c1a1ae42c94834bb5d218442b8df95"><span data-lake-id="ufdbb50d9" id="ufdbb50d9" class="lake-fontsize-12">成功</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua8a4d05d" id="ua8a4d05d"><p data-lake-id="19bc20a6e9167aa68e46c186ba8c230a" id="19bc20a6e9167aa68e46c186ba8c230a"><span data-lake-id="u4b4f2cdd" id="u4b4f2cdd" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回第一次出现的 c 地址</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u1a6697d6" id="u1a6697d6" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="uc9b94651" id="uc9b94651"><p data-lake-id="08cbefb922a7d696b681f9c26fbefb45" id="08cbefb922a7d696b681f9c26fbefb45"><span data-lake-id="u0806210d" id="u0806210d" class="lake-fontsize-12">失败</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u84a83bcb" id="u84a83bcb"><p data-lake-id="387ce16144431436d42e27d98aeaf6ad" id="387ce16144431436d42e27d98aeaf6ad"><span data-lake-id="u4b8c3f61" id="u4b8c3f61" class="lake-fontsize-12">NULL</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="562084c3ea8473b8535a4014e732938d" id="562084c3ea8473b8535a4014e732938d"><span data-lake-id="uf4ca54ce" id="uf4ca54ce" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：</span></p><ul list="uea76abb2"><li fid="uc24b9ee7" data-lake-id="u7a5700cf" id="u7a5700cf"><span data-lake-id="u67769426" id="u67769426" class="lake-fontsize-12">这两个函数的功能，都是在指定的字符串 s 中，试图找到字符 c。</span></li><li fid="uc24b9ee7" data-lake-id="u351b4af0" id="u351b4af0"><span data-lake-id="u7b08e4eb" id="u7b08e4eb" class="lake-fontsize-12">strchr() 从左往右找，strrchr() 从右往左找。</span></li><li fid="uc24b9ee7" data-lake-id="ub97c5b41" id="ub97c5b41"><span data-lake-id="ud73cbaba" id="ud73cbaba" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符串结束标记 '\0' 被认为是字符串的一部分。</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20*p%3B%5Cn%5Cnp%20%3D%20strchr(%5C%22www.qq.com%5C%22%2C%20'.')%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BB%8E%E5%B7%A6%E5%88%B0%E5%8F%B3%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6'.'%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20p)%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%20%5C%22.qq.com%5C%22%5Cn%5Cnp%20%3D%20strrchr(%5C%22www.qq.com%5C%22%2C%20'.')%3B%2F%2F%20%E4%BB%8E%E5%8F%B3%E5%88%B0%E5%B7%A6%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6'.'%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20p)%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%20%5C%22.com%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pzaAE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="F4Ep1" id="F4Ep1"><span data-lake-id="uca0af70b" id="uca0af70b">3.7 sizeof和strlen</span></h2><p data-lake-id="e821b88983f6bc1e6eaf2b1724c2d51d" id="e821b88983f6bc1e6eaf2b1724c2d51d"><span data-lake-id="u1c79b9d4" id="u1c79b9d4" class="lake-fontsize-12">sizeof和strlen区别</span></p><ul list="u4b51d33b"><li fid="u2c21b640" data-lake-id="ud7e33ec2" id="ud7e33ec2"><span data-lake-id="u44683353" id="u44683353" class="lake-fontsize-12">两者没有什么关联</span></li><li fid="u2c21b640" data-lake-id="u5c0c9d83" id="u5c0c9d83"><span data-lake-id="u453df0e9" id="u453df0e9" class="lake-fontsize-12">strlen是一个包含在string.h中的库函数，用于求字符串长度，计算'\0'之前的所有字符个数（不包括'\0'）</span></li><li fid="u2c21b640" data-lake-id="u26081273" id="u26081273"><span data-lake-id="u0fd91629" id="u0fd91629" class="lake-fontsize-12">sizeof是一个运算符，计算变量、数组、类型的大小，单位是字节byte，计算字符串时</span><u><span data-lake-id="ud4eabb4c" id="ud4eabb4c" class="lake-fontsize-12">把'\0'也算入的</span></u><span data-lake-id="ude71a9ec" id="ude71a9ec" class="lake-fontsize-12">。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf5c5f3b8" id="uf5c5f3b8"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="UdqIT" id="UdqIT"><span data-lake-id="uf79189c6" id="uf79189c6">3.8sprintf</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uf32ff01f" id="uf32ff01f"><span data-lake-id="ud3d3c325" id="ud3d3c325" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符串的格式化拼接：</span><span data-lake-id="u7361bc0c" id="u7361bc0c">在拼接字符串的同时，把</span><u><span data-lake-id="ubdcdd530" id="ubdcdd530">各种类型的数据</span></u><span data-lake-id="ub4b86c83" id="ub4b86c83">按照指定格式转换成字符串</span><span data-lake-id="u6780c1c6" id="u6780c1c6" class="lake-fontsize-12">。  </span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20str%5B50%5D%3B%5Cnsprintf(str%2C%20%5C%22%25s%25s%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22Hello%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%20World%5C%22)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20str)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IOBBG%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u5db9f9e1" id="u5db9f9e1"><span data-lake-id="u1fcc3b40" id="u1fcc3b40" class="lake-fontsize-12">-----》snprintf：放置缓冲区溢出，限制最多写入 sizeof（buf）</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20buf%5B100%5D%3B%5Cnchar%20name%5B%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22Tom%5C%22%3B%5Cnint%20age%20%3D%2018%3B%5Cnsnprintf(buf%2C%20sizeof(buf)%2C%20%5C%22%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D%EF%BC%9A%25s%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B4%E9%BE%84%EF%BC%9A%25d%5C%22%2C%20name%2C%20age)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20buf)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D1IP8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card>